{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bm]You would cost me my [D/F#]head before the king
So [G]Daniel spoke to the [A]steward in charge
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[D]Three years of [D/F#]training in [G]Babylon
Keeping [A]faith in the king's [D]court [G][A][D]
